Thought: test a robust median combination to counter unstable rankings and high correlation.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Use a forward‑selection based pool to capture complementary models in this unstable, low‑predictability series, then weight them equally (no weighting) to keep robustness.  

Action: select_forward  

